1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,657
The Cut list tab lists every panel the job needs, grouped by material.

2
00:00:07,657 --> 00:00:10,720
Cut sizes already allow for edgeband thickness. Finished sizes are next to them.

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:19,419
Each row shows which cabinets use the part, the quantity, edges and grain.

4
00:00:19,419 --> 00:00:28,374
Cut list CSV saves the list for the saw or a spreadsheet.

5
00:00:28,374 --> 00:00:39,154
BOM CSV is the bill of materials: sheets, edgeband length and hardware to order.
